    "Yellow": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "黄"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "settings.preview.script": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "大家早上好，谢谢大家今天来到这里。[微笑]\n\n今天我想讲一个简单的道理：把话说清楚，要从放慢速度、一次只对一个人说开始。字句重要，字句之间的停顿也一样重要。[停顿]\n\n深吸一口气，看着镜头，让每一句话都落地。[看镜头] 当我们平静、有目的地说话，再复杂的内容也会变得好懂。\n\n所以保持节奏，相信你要讲的故事，把话说完。谢谢大家。[点头]"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Good morning, and thank you for being here. [smile]\n\nToday I want to share a simple idea: clear communication begins when we slow down and connect with one person at a time. The words matter, but the space between them matters too. [pause]\n\nTake a breath, look into the camera, and let each sentence land. [look at camera] When we speak with calm and purpose, even a complex message becomes easier to understand.\n\nSo keep your pace steady, trust the story, and bring the message home. Thank you for listening. [nod]"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
